<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 30.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Oct 30.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		   Yield     Close</p>
<p> 1 Villa World	     10.48    1.05</p>
<p> 2 Prime Credit Tr	 10.32    0.95</p>
<p> 3 Prop Income Inv	 10.06    1.01</p>
<p> 4 McIntosh Sec	     9.89    0.91</p>
<p> 5 BT Prop Trust	    9.83    1.66</p>
<p> 6 Indu Property	    9.78    0.93</p>
<p> 7 Aust Tour		  9.74    0.77</p>
<p> 8 Colonial Mutual	  9.28    1.14</p>
<p> 9 Central Equity	   9.18    0.98</p>
<p>10 Centro Prop		8.86    2.20</p>
<p>11 Gen Prop Tr		8.74    2.30</p>
<p>12 Armstrong Retail	 8.68    0.76</p>
<p>13 Barclays Mirvac	  8.66    1.27</p>
<p>14 Gandel Retail Tr	 8.57    0.91</p>
<p>15 Equitilink		 8.47    0.59</p>
